---
---
<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Open source <i>·</i> Laravel 12 &amp; 13 <i>·</i> Full-stack ecosystem</p>

    <h1 class="hero-title">Laravel artisans,<br />working <em>in the open</em>.</h1>

    <p class="hero-deck">Koamishin is a growing collective of Laravel artisans — engineers and designers devoted to craft, clarity, and open-source work. We learn in public, hold a high bar, and keep the workshop doors open.</p>

    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#projects">Explore the Projects</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/blog/koamishin-quickstart-in-two-minutes/">Quick Start Guide</a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-proof">
      <div class="avatars" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/team/Rui-Zen-34.png" alt="" width="32" height="32" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
        <img src="/team/SorenOutis-34.png" alt="" width="32" height="32" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
        <img src="/team/Jaymark-34.png" alt="" width="32" height="32" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
        <img src="/team/Angelika-34.png" alt="" width="32" height="32" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
      </div>
      <p>growing Laravel collective <i>·</i> 7 open-source systems <i>·</i> every repo free to fork</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6.5rem) 0 clamp(3.25rem, 7vw, 5.75rem);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .eyebrow i {
    font-style: normal;
    color: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.9);
    margin: 0 0.35rem;
  }

  .hero-title {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .hero-title em {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  .hero-title em::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    left: -0.05em;
    right: -0.05em;
    bottom: 0.02em;
    height: 0.34em;
    background: linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.62), rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.38));
    border-radius: 0.18em 0.3em 0.22em 0.28em;
    transform: rotate(-0.8deg) skewX(-8deg);
  }

  .hero-deck {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.13rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 2.1rem;
  }

  .hero-proof {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 2.4rem;
  }
  .hero-proof .avatars {
    display: flex;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .hero-proof .avatars img {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--cream);
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    margin-left: -8px;
  }
  .hero-proof .avatars img:first-child {
    margin-left: 0;
  }
  .hero-proof p {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-align: left;
  }
  .hero-proof i {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--line-strong);
    margin: 0 0.3rem;
  }

  /* subtle entrance */
  @keyframes heroFadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  .eyebrow { animation: heroFadeUp 0.5s ease both; }
  .hero-title { animation: heroFadeUp 0.6s ease 0.06s both; }
  .hero-deck { animation: heroFadeUp 0.6s ease 0.14s both; }
  .hero-ctas { animation: heroFadeUp 0.6s ease 0.22s both; }
  .hero-proof { animation: heroFadeUp 0.6s ease 0.3s both; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 2.9rem 0 2.6rem;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 9vw, 2.85rem);
      line-height: 1.12;
    }
    .hero-deck {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-top: 1.15rem;
    }
    .hero-ctas {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
      margin-top: 1.8rem;
    }
    .hero-ctas .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .hero-proof {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    .hero-proof p {
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .eyebrow,
    .hero-title,
    .hero-deck,
    .hero-ctas,
    .hero-proof {
      animation: none !important;
      opacity: 1 !important;
      transform: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
